491
00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:10.700
A segue.

492
00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.480
B resolvia fechando chamados que voltavam,

493
00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:15.280
a trapaça que o sem piorar existia

494
00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:15.860
